                                    <component>cache</component>
                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>1</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16719829" author="sboikov" created="Thu, 13 Dec 2018 06:50:55 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&apos;Get&apos; operation on near cache client updates&#160;value in near cache entry&#160;using method GridNearCacheEntry.loadedValue. This method assumes that field &apos;GridNearCacheEntry.dhtVer&apos; contains latest version, but&#160;&apos;dhtVer&apos; was not&#160;changed after &#160;updates in atomic cache. This was fixed (859b37cc8016e4d12178d80e717bd52f992d6e34).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
